{"id":"n61644-2-7","stage":3,"title":"사우나 · 桑拿","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61644-2-7-1","ko":"하루 종일 몸이 찌뿌둥하네.","zh":"一整天都觉得浑身没劲呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"1","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}},{"text":"몸이","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"몸이","audio":"/audio/5a8fb4d5acf8e6fe3214.mp3"}},{"text":"찌뿌둥하네.","meaning":"身体沉重不舒坦","explanation":"찌뿌둥하다：身体沉重不舒坦；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"찌뿌둥하다","audio":"/audio/4da2a02d48dd08e1b1bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"course:찌뿌둥하다:1","senseId":"1","lemma":"찌뿌둥하다","origin":"course-authored supplement"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찌뿌둥하네","audio":"/audio/0a826af4ab8a0c1a4047.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"从晚上12点到第二天晚上12点的24个小时。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一天到晚","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91758","definition":"从早晨到夜晚的时间段。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"4da2a02d48dd08e1","term":"찌뿌둥하다","zh":"身体沉重不舒坦","audio":"/audio/4da2a02d48dd08e1b1bd.mp3","definition":"本句指全身发沉、疲倦不舒坦。","pronunciation":[]}],"audio":"/audio/418cdc92cc1310bdfc6b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61644-2-7-2","ko":"저녁에 사우나에 가서 땀이나 빼고 오자.","zh":"晚上去桑拿馆出出汗吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"傍晚","explanation":"저녁：傍晚；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"1","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저녁에","audio":"/audio/adc9d30ae9de01c054e6.mp3"}},{"text":"사우나에","meaning":"桑拿","explanation":"사우나：桑拿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사우나","audio":"/audio/da69ba98156a5974e4de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61644","senseId":"2","lemma":"사우나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사우나에","audio":"/audio/56f041ffcbed132d5ccc.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"땀이나","meaning":"汗","explanation":"땀：汗；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"땀","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50523","senseId":"1","lemma":"땀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땀이나","audio":"/audio/8e31198302bae52418d8.mp3"}},{"text":"빼고","meaning":"泄，丧","explanation":"빼다：泄，丧；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"8","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼고","audio":"/audio/f941948a515dbdf787c3.mp3"}},{"text":"오자.","meaning":"到，来到","explanation":"오다：到，来到；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"10","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오자","audio":"/audio/55b7db110c0d5bb5543b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"傍晚","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"从太阳落山开始到晚上的时间。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"da69ba98156a5974","term":"사우나","zh":"桑拿","audio":"/audio/da69ba98156a5974e4de.mp3","entryId":"61644","definition":"制造热蒸气并用其发汗洗浴的场所。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"4a87f76767f67dcd","term":"땀","zh":"汗","audio":"/audio/4a87f76767f67dcdd48c.mp3","entryId":"50523","definition":"感到热、身体不舒服或紧张时通过皮肤分泌的咸津津的清澈液体。","pronunciation":["땀"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"泄，丧","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"使身体没有力气或劲头等。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"到，来到","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"到达想去的地方。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/caf6ca2be0c8aec6253a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.896,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61644","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":96,"sequenceScore":2.5494,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一整天都觉得浑身没劲呢。","晚上去桑拿馆出出汗吧。","从新年开始就这么努力工作啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["一整天都觉得浑身没劲呢。","晚上去桑拿馆出出汗吧。","从新年开始就这么努力工作啊？"],"answer":1}]}
